+### Follower Configuration
+
+**Step 24: Attach Gripper**
+
+- Attach the gripper to motor 5.
+
+<img
+  src="https://huggingface.co/datasets/huggingface/documentation-images/resolve/main/lerobot/so100_assembly_24.webp"
